OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FFrom the 2025 Proms, soloists
OL,7,     FHilary Cronin, Hugh Cutting and
OL,8,     FStuart Jackson join the Irish
OL,9,     FBaroque Orchestra and Chorus and
OL,10,     Fconductor Peter Whelan in Handel's
OL,11,     FAlexander's Feast.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,17,     FTom Service talks to pianist Dame
OL,18,     FImogen Cooper about her life in
OL,19,     Fmusic, and saxophonist Salvador
OL,20,     FFlores plays live in the studio.
