OL,5,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,6,     FJools is joined by the Duran Duran
OL,7,     Fsinger Simon Le Bon, with music by
OL,8,     FSibelius, Purcell and Meredith
OL,9,     FMonk.
OL,10,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,11,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,12,     FMusic. 1846, Birmingham. The
OL,13,     Fpremiere of Mendelssohn's Elijah
OL,14,     Fputs the city on the musical map.
OL,15,G1400 Record Review
OL,16,     FAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,17,     Fthe week's new classical releases,
OL,18,     Fjoined by Allyson Devenish and
OL,19,     FDavid Owen Norris, who surveys
OL,20,     Frecordings of Walton's
OL,21,     FBelshazzar's Feast.
